arbeitnow:lead-full-stack-software-engin:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mission Brief&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Isar Aerospace, we are building the technology and infrastructure needed to make access to space more affordable, sustainable, and scalable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a highly skilled, hands-on &lt;strong&gt;Lead Full Stack Software Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to lead the development of modern internal software platforms and applications that support our rapidly growing organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will design and build software solutions that connect people, processes, and data across engineering, manufacturing, operations, and business functions. You will work directly with stakeholders to understand challenges, identify opportunities for automation and digitalization, and turn ideas into intuitive, scalable applications.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an opportunity to take ownership of greenfield software development, influence architectural decisions, and help shape how we build internal technology at Isar Aerospace.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for someone who enjoys solving complex problems, moves quickly from concept to working software, and combines strong engineering fundamentals with a pragmatic, product-oriented mindset.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your role in our Space Mission...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Software Development &amp;amp; Architecture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the design, development, and deployment of modern internal applications and software platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build scalable, maintainable full-stack solutions, including frontend interfaces, backend services, APIs, and databases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take technical ownership of applications from initial concept and prototyping through production deployment and ongoing evolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and implement software architecture, data models, integration patterns, and development standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure solutions meet appropriate requirements for performance, reliability, security, and maintainability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish engineering best practices, including automated testing, code reviews, CI/CD, and documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Development &amp;amp; Innovation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate directly with stakeholders across engineering, manufacturing, operations, and business teams to identify opportunities for software-driven improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate complex operational requirements into intuitive, user-friendly applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rapidly prototype new ideas, validate solutions with end users, and iterate based on feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop applications that streamline workflows, improve data accessibility, increase transparency, and reduce manual processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to replace fragmented tools, spreadsheets, and manual workflows with integrated software solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance rapid delivery of business value with sound long-term technical decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Systems Integration &amp;amp; Data&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement integrations between internally developed applications, enterprise software, and engineering systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop robust APIs and data services to enable interoperability across the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with relational databases, structured and unstructured data, and modern data management approaches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with enterprise systems and data engineering teams to ensure applications integrate effectively into the broader technology landscape.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Leadership &amp;amp; AI-Assisted Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a technical leader, setting engineering direction and guiding architectural decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion modern software development approaches, including AI-assisted coding and agentic development tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use technologies such as GitHub Copilot, Claude Code, or OpenAI Codex to accelerate prototyping, development, testing, and documentation where appropriate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate emerging technologies and development approaches, selecting tools based on practical business value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the growth of internal software engineering capabilities, including mentoring future team members.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster a culture of ownership, experimentation, continuous improvement, and high-quality engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you´ll need to thrive...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of professional software engineering experience, including substantial hands-on full-stack development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong proficiency in modern frontend development using TypeScript/JavaScript and frameworks such as React, Angular, or Vue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing backend applications and APIs using Python, &lt;a href="http://node.js/"&gt;Node.js&lt;/a&gt;, Java, C#, or comparable technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of relational databases such as PostgreSQL, MySQL, or SQL Server, including data modeling and query optimization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing and delivering production applications, including authentication, authorization, testing, deployment, and monitoring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of software architecture, distributed systems, and application integration patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Git, automated testing, CI/CD pipelines, and modern development workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to independently take an idea from requirements through implementation and deployment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving skills, intellectual curiosity, and a pragmatic approach to engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to collaborate effectively with stakeholders from different technical and business backgrounds.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills in English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building internal tools, operational applications, or enterprise software platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing software for manufacturing, automotive, aerospace, logistics, or other complex operational environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with ERP, PLM, or other enterprise systems and their integration interfaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building responsive web applications and mobile-friendly interfaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with cloud platforms, containerization, Docker, and Kubernetes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with event-driven architectures, data pipelines, or real-time applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience using AI coding assistants and autonomous coding agents to improve software development productivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in fast-growing companies or greenfield product development environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience providing technical leadership, mentoring developers, or owning application architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span lang="EN-US"&gt;&lt;span class="EOP Selected SCXW224169733 BCX0" data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:360}"&gt;Beyond technical proficiency, we´re looking for someone who...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Builds, not just designs.&lt;/strong&gt; You are comfortable making architectural decisions but equally happy writing code, debugging issues, and delivering working software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Thinks like a product owner.&lt;/strong&gt; You care about the end user's experience and the real-world problems your software solves.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Thrives in ambiguity.&lt;/strong&gt; You can turn loosely defined problems into actionable requirements and working solutions without extensive direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Moves quickly and pragmatically.&lt;/strong&gt; You understand when to prototype rapidly and when to invest in robust, scalable engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Takes ownership.&lt;/strong&gt; You are comfortable being accountable for the applications you build, from initial concept through production operation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Embraces new tools.&lt;/strong&gt; You actively explore modern development techniques, including AI-assisted software engineering, while maintaining high standards for code quality and security.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enjoys collaboration.&lt;/strong&gt; You like working directly with the people who use your software and seeing the impact of your work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are a hands-on engineer who enjoys building products, solving complex problems, and turning ideas into working software, we'd love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span lang="EN-US"&gt;Benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang="EN-US"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employee Participation Program:&lt;/strong&gt; Share in our success through our virtual company share program&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang="EN-US"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;30 days of vacation: &lt;/strong&gt;Enjoy the days off to relax and recharge &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang="EN-US"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Company pension plan:&lt;/strong&gt; Secure your future with our company pension plan, featuring a 20% employer contribution after the probation period&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang="EN-US"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Subsidised lunch:&lt;/strong&gt; Stay energised with delicious, subsidised lunches every day&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang="EN-US"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Public transport ticket:&lt;/strong&gt; Commute with ease using a fully financed Deutschlandticket&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang="EN-US"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rental clothing with laundry service:&lt;/strong&gt; Enjoy hassle-free workwear with our convenient rental clothing and laundry service &amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang="EN-US"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sport Clubs membership:&lt;/strong&gt; Stay fit with our sponsored sports club memberships (EGYM Wellpass)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang="EN-US"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Individual learning allowance:&lt;/strong&gt; Grow your skills with an individual learning budget granted after the probation period&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang="EN-US"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Childcare allowance:&lt;/strong&gt; Receive a childcare allowance for your non-school-age children&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang="EN-US"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;And Much More!&lt;/strong&gt; Discover additional perks and benefits when you join our team. &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span lang="EN-US"&gt;Who we are&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span lang="EN-US"&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/jW2V5vsMb_k" width="560" height="314"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang="EN-US"&gt;We are Isar Aerospace and we are at the forefront of New Space building a modern space business to enable faster, better and cheaper access to space.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang="EN-US"&gt;Our mission is to help democratise space and use it for good in order to improve life on Earth now and for the future generations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang="EN-US"&gt;We are a fast-growing company aiming to provide sustainable and environmentally friendly launch solutions for small and medium-sized satellites and constellations into Low Earth Orbit. The company is privately funded by world-leading technology investors with strong commitment and support and our team is made of driven and talented people with a real passion for space innovation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang="EN-US"&gt;We're making rockets in a way that hasn't been done before disrupting a traditional industry. If you are up for the challenge, want to work on cutting-edge projects and be part of a team changing the world for better, come, join us and launch your career!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang="EN-US"&gt;Want to find out more about us?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang="EN-US"&gt;Visit &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang="DE"&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.isaraerospace.com/"&gt;www.isaraerospace.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Protection&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We process your personal data for the purpose of managing the recruitment process and assessing your application. For detailed information on how your data is processed, including your rights, please refer to our &lt;a href="https://isaraerospace.com/privacy-policy"&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span lang="DE"&gt;Disclaimer&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span lang="DE"&gt;&lt;span lang="EN-US"&gt;Isar Aerospace SE is an equal-opportunity employer committed to fairness and inclusivity. We do not prioritize any specific religion, gender, nationality, or background. Due to security clearance requirements, affiliations with countries listed under § 13 para. 1 no. 17 SÜG may affect the application process. All qualified applicants are encouraged to apply.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

arbeitnow:senior-linux-administrator-cam:
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Linux Administrator&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Cambridge, UK | Full-time | Permanent | Hybrid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Salary: £60,000 to £75,000 + Bonus + Equity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{}"&gt;&lt;em&gt;T&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;he salary range for this role is broad, as we are able to consider varying levels of experience.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Any offer made will carefully take into account level of experience (including relevant industry experience), transferable relevant skills and previous relevant achievements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;About us&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;Riverlane’s&amp;nbsp;mission is to master quantum error correction (QEC) and unlock a new age of human progress. From advances in material and climate science, to complex chemistry simulation for new drug design, quantum computers will help humanity solve some of its most important challenges. But without QEC, the industry’s defining technical challenge, such breakthroughs can never be achieved.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Riverlane is the world leader in QEC technology. QEC is a complex problem that requires a range of skills,&amp;nbsp;talent&amp;nbsp;and passion.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class="TextRun SCXW243923852 BCX8" lang="EN-US" data-contrast="none"&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW243923852 BCX8"&gt;Having raised more than $125M in funding to date to accelerate our&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW243923852 BCX8"&gt;cutting-edge&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW243923852 BCX8"&gt;&amp;nbsp;R&amp;amp;D in quantum error correction (QEC), Riverlane partners with many of the world’s leading quantum hardware providers and government agencies to make fault-tolerant quantum computing a reality.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW243923852 BCX8"&gt;We’re&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW243923852 BCX8"&gt;&amp;nbsp;making remarkable progress and growing fast. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="EOP SCXW243923852 BCX8" data-ccp-props="{}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;About the role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{}"&gt;Riverlane is looking for an experienced Linux administrator to own and grow our core computational infrastructure. This is a hands-on role combining day-to-day administration of our High-Performance Computing (HPC) environment with longer-term planning, automation, and improvement of our infrastructure estate.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You'll be the primary owner of our HPC cluster and core Linux infrastructure, working closely with IT management and wider Infrastructure Team to keep systems reliable today while building towards a more resilient, scalable environment for tomorrow.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{}"&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;HPC Cluster Administration&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Administer and maintain the HPC cluster, including compute nodes, storage systems, and networking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate and evolve cluster topology, compute node configuration, and hardware resource utilisation as the estate grows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the deployment, configuration, and troubleshooting of HPC tooling, particularly Slurm — including queue structures and job scheduling policies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor system performance and ensure high availability of HPC resources, using observability tools such as Prometheus; investigate anomalies and outages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assess and maintain the network file storage solution for throughput, scalability, and latency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Business As Usual (BAU) Administration&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain, patch, and troubleshoot core Linux infrastructure (RHEL).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as an escalation point for complex technical issues raised by the Riverlane team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide operational upkeep of core infrastructure, including servers, tooling, and licence managers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain Synopsys EDA tooling, including licence server management, environment configuration, and performance optimisation for electronic design automation workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide sound technical support to users of the HPC environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve self-service capability for users, enabling routine tasks (e.g. restarting VNC sessions, resetting passwords) to be performed without engineering intervention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Automation &amp;amp; Enhancement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automate routine tasks using scripting and infrastructure-as-code tools (Bash, Python, Ansible).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with the Infrastructure Team to plan and implement improvements to HPC infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own work packages and deliver them within agreed sprint windows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain documentation for systems, processes, and configurations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate effectively with stakeholders on progress and delivered improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Security, Compliance &amp;amp; Resilience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure security and compliance across the HPC estate, including security hardening and lifecycle management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain and develop the off-site backup strategy, ensuring data integrity, disaster recovery readiness, and compliance with data retention policies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience administering and growing infrastructure in fast-paced engineering environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enterprise Linux expertise: deep knowledge of Red Hat Enterprise Linux (RHEL) administration, security hardening, lifecycle management, and troubleshooting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience configuring, scaling, tuning, and troubleshooting job schedulers (e.g. Slurm) and distributed compute environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of network file storage protocols and network optimisation for computational workloads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient with container environments and virtualisation infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High proficiency with infrastructure automation tools (Ansible, Python, Bash) and infrastructure-as-code practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with backup and disaster recovery strategy and implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing licensed EDA or similar specialist software tooling (e.g. Synopsys) is a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills, with the ability to support both technical and non-technical users and translate complex issues into clear guidance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;What can you expect from us&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="22" data-list-defn-props="{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}" data-aria-posinset="1" data-aria-level="1"&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;A comprehensive benefits package that includes&amp;nbsp;an annual bonus plan,&amp;nbsp;private medical insurance, life insurance, and a&amp;nbsp;contributory pension scheme&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="22" data-list-defn-props="{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}" data-aria-posinset="1" data-aria-level="1"&gt;Equity, so that our team can share in the long-term success of Riverlane &lt;span data-ccp-props="{}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="22" data-list-defn-props="{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}" data-aria-posinset="1" data-aria-level="1"&gt;28 days annual leave, plus bank holidays and enhanced family leave&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="22" data-list-defn-props="{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}" data-aria-posinset="1" data-aria-level="1"&gt;A diverse work environment that brings together experts in many fields (including software and hardware development, quantum information theory, physics and maths) and over 20 different nationalities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="22" data-list-defn-props="{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}" data-aria-posinset="1" data-aria-level="1"&gt;A learning environment that encourages individual, team and company growth and development, including a regular programme of learning events and training and conference budgets&lt;span data-ccp-props="{}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;How to apply&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Please upload a CV and covering letter by clicking 'Apply'. Your covering letter should explain why you are applying for the job and what skills and experience you can bring to the role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;We review CVs as we receive them and interview as soon as we have applications that&amp;nbsp;look&amp;nbsp;like a good match. We do not use closing dates. So, please&amp;nbsp;apply as soon as possible to avoid&amp;nbsp;missing out on&amp;nbsp;this role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;If you have any queries, please contact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a ----- data-contrast="none"&gt;&lt;span ----- data-ccp-charstyle="Hyperlink"&gt;com&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Everyone is welcome at Riverlane. We are an equal opportunities employer and encourage applications from eligible and suitably qualified candidates regardless of age, disability, ethnicity, gender, gender reassignment, religion or belief, sexual orientation, marital or civil partnership status, or pregnancy and maternity/paternity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;Women and other underrepresented groups may be less likely to apply for a role unless they meet all or&amp;nbsp;nearly all&amp;nbsp;of the requirements.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;If this applies to you, we still encourage you to apply - you may be a great fit, even if you&amp;nbsp;don’t&amp;nbsp;meet every single qualification.&amp;nbsp;We’d&amp;nbsp;love to hear from you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;If you need any adjustments made to the application or selection process so you can do your best, please let us know. We will be happy to help.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{}"&gt;GDPR notice: Riverlane collects and processes personal data in accordance with applicable data protection laws. If you are a European Job Applicant see the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a id="OWA843b0309-1485-8922-978c-b4a29d28b8a6" class="x_x_fui-Link x_x____1q1shib x_x_f2hkw1w x_x_f3rmtva x_x_f1ewtqcl x_x_fyind8e x_x_f1k6fduh x_x_f1w7gpdv x_x_fk6fouc x_x_fjoy568 x_x_figsok6 x_x_f1s184ao x_x_f1mk8lai x_x_fnbmjn9 x_x_f1o700av x_x_f13mvf36 x_x_f1cmlufx x_x_f9n3di6 x_x_f1ids18y x_x_f1tx3yz7 x_x_f1deo86v x_x_f1eh06m1 x_x_f1iescvh x_x_fhgqx19 x_x_f1olyrje x_x_f1p93eir x_x_f1nev41a x_x_f1h8hb77 x_x_f1lqvz6u x_x_f10aw75t x_x_fsle3fq x_x_f17ae5zn x_x_OWAAutoLink" href="https://riverlane.workable.com/gdpr_policy/v1?lang=en" data-auth="NotApplicable" data-linkindex="1"&gt;privacy notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; for further details.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

arbeitnow:staff-site-reliability-enginee:
&lt;div class="gmail_default" style="font-size: small;"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Mozilla?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Mozilla Corporation is the non-profit-backed technology company that has shaped the internet for the better over the last 25 years. We make pioneering brands like Firefox, the privacy-minded web browser. Now, with more than 225 million people around the world using our products each month, we’re shaping the next 25 years of technology and helping to reclaim an internet built for people, not companies. Our work focuses on diverse areas including AI, social media, security and more. And we’re doing this while never losing our focus on our core mission – to make the internet better for people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;The Mozilla Corporation is wholly owned by the non-profit 501(c) Mozilla Foundation. This means we aren’t beholden to any shareholders — only to our mission. Along with thousands of volunteer contributors and collaborators all over the world, Mozillians design, build and distribute &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;open-source&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt; software that enables people to enjoy the internet on their terms. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;About this team and role:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;We are looking for an experienced and versatile software engineer to work on the tools and systems that support Firefox engineering.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;This is a broad software engineering role spanning internal engineering systems, developer tooling, workflow automation, and the infrastructure required to operate them. We are looking for an engineer with strong software development skills and meaningful experience deploying and operating production systems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Our Cloud Engineering teams provide shared platforms and foundational services, while engineering teams own the applications and services they run on them. A key part of this role is helping teams succeed in that model by solving difficult operational problems, establishing standards and patterns, and building tooling and automation that makes systems easier to operate. You will also contribute directly to the software, tools, and systems that support Firefox engineering.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;You will work across projects and technical domains, joining teams or existing efforts when needed and independently taking on problems that require focused ownership.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;We build in the open. Open source is fundamental to how we work, and contributing back to the broader open-source ecosystem is an important part of the role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;What you'll do:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Design, build, deploy, and operate software and systems supporting Firefox engineering.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Contribute to developer tooling, CI/CD, workflow automation, and AI-assisted development tools.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Own complex technical problems end-to-end across software, cloud, and operational layers, improving reliability, performance, observability, and cost efficiency.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Work with Firefox engineering, Cloud Engineering, IT, and other teams to solve problems that span technical and organizational boundaries.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Use telemetry, metrics, and data analysis to investigate problems and guide engineering decisions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Contribute to architecture and technical strategy, identifying recurring problems and solutions that can be applied across teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;What you'll bring:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Strong software engineering skills and substantial hands-on experience deploying and operating production systems are core requirements for this role. We do not expect you to be an expert in every technology or domain listed below.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Strong programming skills in languages such as Python or JavaScript/TypeScript. Experience with C++ or Rust is useful.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Experience building and deploying and operating production systems in cloud environments, including utilizing infrastructure as code such as Terraform.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Experience across several areas such as CI/CD, containers and orchestration, networking, databases, observability, or developer tooling.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Experience using data, telemetry, and metrics to investigate technical problems and make decisions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Familiarity with modern AI-assisted development tools and an understanding of their capabilities, limitations, and appropriate use.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;How you work:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;You are comfortable jumping into unfamiliar systems and getting them into a sustainable state.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;You enjoy moving across projects and technical domains, taking ownership of problems and looking for patterns that make the next one easier to solve.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;You work effectively across disciplines and can translate between software, infrastructure, and operational concerns.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;You combine hands-on engineering with systems thinking and longer-term technical judgment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;You communicate openly, consistently, and respectfully, and enjoy teaching and helping others build skills in unfamiliar technical areas.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll get:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Generous performance-based bonus plans to all eligible employees - we share in our success as one team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Rich medical, dental, and vision coverage&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Generous retirement contributions with 100% immediate vesting (regardless of whether you contribute)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Quarterly all-company wellness days where everyone takes a pause together&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Country specific holidays plus a day off for your birthday&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;One-time home office stipend&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Annual professional development budget&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Quarterly well-being stipend&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Considerable paid parental leave&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Employee referral bonus program&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Other benefits (life/AD&amp;amp;D, disability, EAP, etc. - varies by country)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Mozilla&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mozilla exists to build the Internet as a public resource accessible to all because we believe that open and free is better than closed and controlled. When you work at Mozilla, you give yourself a chance to make a difference in the lives of Web users everywhere. And you give us a chance to make a difference in your life every single day. Join us to work on the Web as the platform and help create more opportunity and innovation for everyone online.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commitment to diversity, equity, inclusion, and belonging&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mozilla understands that valuing diverse creative practices and forms of knowledge are crucial to and enrich the company’s core mission.&amp;nbsp; We encourage applications from everyone, including members of all equity-seeking communities, such as (but certainly not limited to) women, racialized and Indigenous persons, persons with disabilities, persons of all sexual orientation&lt;span style="color: #003366;"&gt;s, &lt;/span&gt;gender identities, and expressions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We will ensure that qualified individuals with disabilities are provided reasonable accommodations to participate in the job application or interview process, to perform essential job functions, and to receive other benefits and privileges of employment, as appropriate. Please contact us at &lt;a class="external-link" ---------- to request accommodation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer. We do not discriminate on the basis of race (including hairstyle and texture), religion (including religious grooming and dress practices), gender, gender identity, gender expression, color, national origin, pregnancy, ancestry, domestic partner status, disability, sexual orientation, age, genetic predisposition, medical condition, marital status, citizenship status, military or veteran status, or any other basis covered by applicable laws.&amp;nbsp; Mozilla will not tolerate discrimination or harassment based on any of these characteristics or any other unlawful behavior, conduct, or purpose.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Group: C&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-REMOTE&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Req ID: R3254&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="content-pay-transparency"&gt;&lt;div class="pay-input"&gt;&lt;div class="description"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hiring Ranges:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="title"&gt;Remote Germany&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="pay-range"&gt;&lt;span&gt;€81.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="divider"&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€108.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

arbeitnow:experimentation-tracking-engin:
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span class="notion-enable-hover" data-token-index="0"&gt;🧡 &lt;/span&gt;About Alma&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Alma, we believe sustainable commerce depends on fair, well-balanced trade. Because finance plays a pivotal role in business, our mission is to put it back in its rightful place: serving merchants and consumers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our installment and deferred payment solutions help merchants boost sales by 20% or more, increase customer loyalty, and deliver a seamless shopping experience, without encouraging bad debt.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the buy now pay later leader in France and active in 10 European countries, we've empowered over 25,000 merchants and 10 million consumers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With 380+ Almakers and €100M+ ARR, Alma is scaling rapidly across Europe as a member of the Next40, and we're just getting started!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span class="notion-enable-hover" data-token-index="0"&gt;👐 &lt;/span&gt;About the team&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will join the Growth team and work closely with Revenue Operations, Account Managers, Business Analysts, Marketing, Data, and merchant technical teams. You will help Alma apply to its own website the experimentation and measurement expertise we bring to merchants.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a permanent, full-time position based in Paris, with a hybrid working model. Professional French and English are required.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span class="notion-enable-hover" data-token-index="0"&gt;💼 &lt;/span&gt;About the job&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Experimentation &amp;amp; Tracking Engineer, you will own web experimentation at Alma: the A/B tests we run on merchant websites, the measurement of what happens on our own website, and its continued development following our recent redesign.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your responsibilities will include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead merchant experimentation from opportunity to readout&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Qualify testing opportunities against technical and volume eligibility criteria, then design each test with the merchant: scenario, traffic split, pages, events, KPIs, duration, and stopping rule.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement variations and event tracking in Kameleoon, run the live phase, check data quality, and present the first results to the merchant alongside the Account Manager and Business Analysts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own web tracking and measurement quality&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and maintain the tracking plan for Alma's website across 8 markets, implementing it through GTM, GA4, or equivalent tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure reliable data flows into Salesforce, BigQuery, and Looker, while owning consent and GDPR compliance, deduplication, attribution, and reconciliation across sources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and optimize &lt;a href="http://almapay.com"&gt;almapay.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and evolve landing pages, product pages, market pages, and local content following the website redesign.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run a CRO programme on Alma's own funnels, starting with the demo request, while maintaining performance, Core Web Vitals, technical SEO, and hreflang across markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale the experimentation practice&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn the existing framework, documentation, and tooling into a repeatable practice, with a target of 8 merchant tests going live over the year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share standards, learnings, and results with Growth, Revenue Operations, Data, Marketing, Sales, and Product stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span class="notion-enable-hover" data-token-index="0"&gt;🧰 &lt;/span&gt;You will work with&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Kameleoon, Google Tag Manager, Google Analytics 4, JavaScript, HTML, CSS, Salesforce, BigQuery, Looker, Looker Studio, Metabase, n8n, Make, Notion, Slack, GitHub.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span class="notion-enable-hover" data-token-index="0"&gt;🧩 &lt;/span&gt;About you&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To succeed in this job&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 3 to 5 years of experience in experimentation, web analytics, CRO, or measurement-oriented web development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have hands-on experience with GTM and GA4, or equivalent tools, including consent mode, data quality, and debugging issues that can fail silently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are self-sufficient in JavaScript and HTML/CSS, including DOM manipulation, variation building, and debugging on websites you did not build and cannot fully control.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You understand the fundamentals of test validity, including sample size, stopping rules, and what makes an experiment result trustworthy. You are also comfortable working with clients and technical stakeholders in French and English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;And it will be nice if you also&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have an e-commerce or payments background, with familiarity with checkout journeys.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can use SQL to pull and investigate your own data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have worked with Kameleoon, Optimizely, AB Tasty, VWO, or a similar experimentation platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Speak Spanish, Italian, or German.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Don't meet every single requirement? At Alma, we believe great hires come from diverse paths. If this role excites you, we encourage you to apply. We value potential, curiosity, and the ability to grow as much as experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span class="notion-enable-hover" data-token-index="0"&gt;🧘 &lt;/span&gt;What's in it for you&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you join, you will be able to grow and impact on:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Owning a broad, high-impact scope as Alma's internal reference for experimentation and tracking, with the autonomy to shape the practice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Seeing the direct business outcomes of your work: your tests inform how Alma wins and retains merchants, and your findings are presented to real customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working across dozens of merchant websites, 8 markets, and several CMS platforms, while being supported by a central Data team and Business Analysts for deeper analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span class="notion-enable-hover" data-token-index="0"&gt;🤑 &lt;/span&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary based on 12 months&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Profit-sharing and employee savings plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health insurance: 100% covered by Alma, including family package&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Disability insurance: 100% covered by Alma&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sport: partnerships with Gymlib and ClassPass, or €30/month reimbursement for your sports activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maternity/paternity leave: salary maintained at 100% during leave with no seniority requirement. Return to work at a 4/5 schedule paid at 100% for 8 weeks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sustainable Mobility Package (FMD): €544.80/year, excluding full-remote contracts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meal vouchers: €10/day, 50% covered by Alma&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental health: free access to the MindDay platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid time off: 25 days/year, plus additional paid leave for employees on executive contracts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to our Learning &amp;amp; Development Platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2 weeks of full remote possible per year in summer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span class="notion-enable-hover" data-token-index="0"&gt;🎯 &lt;/span&gt;Interview Process&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Video call with a Talent Acquisition team member to understand your background and motivation, and present the role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Video call with the hiring manager from Revenue Operations &amp;amp; Growth to discuss the role, the team, your experience, and your questions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical case: scope an A/B test from a real merchant scenario and present your approach, including project management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-interviews with a Sales or Account Management stakeholder and a Business Analyst you will work with.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Final conversation with leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span class="notion-enable-hover" data-token-index="0"&gt;🌍 &lt;/span&gt;Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Alma, we believe that diversity fuels innovation and makes our community stronger. We are committed to building a workplace where every person feels seen, respected, and empowered to do their best work whatever their gender, background, ethnicity, age, sexual orientation, religion, disability, or lived experience. As an equal opportunity employer, we welcome applicants from all walks of life, and all employment decisions are made based on qualifications, merit, and business needs.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
